  "content": {
    "id": "p45-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "A projectile from the origin follows $y=\\frac53x-\\frac{5}{216}x^2$. Find:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p45-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "the angle of projection to 1 d.p.,",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$59.0^\\circ$ above the horizontal.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx}&=\\frac53-\\frac{5x}{108}\\\\\\tan\\theta&=\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{x=0}=\\frac53\\\\\\theta&=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac53\\right)\\approx59.0^\\circ\\end{aligned}$$\nThe angle of projection is $59.0^\\circ$ above the horizontal.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 19
      },
      {
        "id": "p45-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "the range,",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$72$ units.",
          "worked": "At ground level, $y=0$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac53x-\\frac{5x^2}{216}&=0\\\\5x\\left(\\frac13-\\frac{x}{216}\\right)&=0\\\\x&=0\\text{ or }72\\end{aligned}$$\nThe nonzero intercept gives a range of $72$ units.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 21
      },
      {
        "id": "p45-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "the greatest height.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$30$ units.",
          "worked": "At the greatest height, $\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac53-\\frac{5x}{108}&=0\\\\x&=36\\\\y(36)&=\\frac53(36)-\\frac{5}{216}(36)^2\\\\&=30\\end{aligned}$$\nThe greatest height is $30$ units.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
    ]
  },
